# version and date-released name the latest release published to npm:
# 1.0.1, published on 7 June 2026 from the tag v1.0.1. Update both when a
# new version is published. No DOI has been minted, so doi is left out.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, with the version or commit you used."
type: software
title: "Zodiacs SDK (@zodiacs/sdk)"
abstract: >-
  Zodiacs SDK is the official read-only TypeScript SDK for building astrology
  apps with verified Zodiac ownership. It recognizes official Zodiacs, reads
  public ownership, computes identity context, and gives astrology apps a
  factual ownership layer for shelves, receipts, profiles, Aura pages, and AI
  astrology context. Its registry models the twelve signs as one canonical
  asset universe: one native Solana SPL mint and one official bridged Base
  ERC-20 representation per sign, with provenance from every Base
  representation back to its Solana origin.
authors:
  - name: "Zodiacs.org"
    website: "https://zodiacs.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zodiacs-org/sdk"
url: "https://zodiacs.org/sdk/"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-06-07"
keywords:
  - astrology
  - zodiac
  - canonical registry
  - verified ownership
  - read-only
  - Solana
  - Base
  - bridged assets
  - symbolic identity
  - React
  - TypeScript
